backend_pid               | 14767
connected                 | 1
pid                       | 14601
backend_id                | 0
status                    | Idle
load_balance_node         | 0
client_host               | 127.0.0.1
client_port               | 54072
statement                 | 
-[ RECORD 4 ]-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
database                  | test
